	"notes": "Prices ex VAT: 464201 €1.56 × 200 = 312.00; 470418 €25.20 × 10 = 252.00; 472186 €2.63 × 50 = 131.50; total 695.50. Weekly: 3,900 + 695.50 = 4,595.50 ≤ 5,000; adding another 695.50 = 5,291 > 5,000, so B is held. 479999 is inside the id range but not in the catalogue: unknown ids look 'undeliverable' at the API, so they are rejected before calling. The budget week is the ISO week of the delivery date (2026-W47 for both 16 and 18 Nov). Plans are keyed by their place_order idempotency key; commits use their own key, because idempotency is per (workspace, caller, key)."
